--- a/ipfs_datasets_py/logic/autoformal/docs/HANDOFF.md
+++ b/ipfs_datasets_py/logic/autoformal/docs/HANDOFF.md
@@ -4040,3 +4040,8 @@
 ## Evidence571 — Native Lean expected-proposition and dependency checks
 
 The current Lean backend and proof protocol passed three direct fixture cases on Lean 4.34.1. Two version probes and three compilations ran. The positive proof matched its expected proposition and reported no axioms. Lean returned exit code 1 on the wrong-type control and reported that the theorem had type True where False was required. The Classical.em fixture compiled with exit code 0. The proof policy refused it because its generated obligation depended on propext, Classical.choice and Quot.sound, outside the empty approved set. Source and resource custody closed. This adds fixture evidence for the existing code and records zero pytest cases. Statutory and corpus admission remain open. [Current Native3 qualification](/tmp/Root-P1-Guide570-existing-Native3-expected-policy-v594-ichhgq4e/actual-current-Lean-Native3-expected-policy-cases-closed-v594.json) · [Separate v567 cache check](/tmp/codex-all-work-github-main-reconciliation-20261123-etm066qn/Phase8-existing-native-CI-trigger-repair-private-v01/coordination-full-goal-v02/actual-P1-current-exact-Lean-wrapper-and-cache-native-qualification-closed-v567.json) · [Historical v39 Native3 check](/tmp/Root-current-Native3-5commands-3cases-authenticated-PASS-v39.json)
+
+
+## Evidence572 — Digest-pinned current review for retained V4 handoffs
+
+The physical V4 release CLI accepts independently digest-pinned review inputs through `--current-review` and `--current-review-sha256`. The healthy fixture attaches the exact saved handoff. Revocation refuses both the closure and its attachment. Proof eligibility remains pending. A fresh Source42 read and ordinary pytest run on the reconciled candidate at cbc43a5f with Accelerate at 219ba3da passed all 33 cases across 15 functions. The run covered 22 retained coordinator cases, four retained handoff cases, and seven CLI cases. The separate private suite improved from eight passes and seven failures to 15 passes. The earlier isolated run remains historical evidence. Statutory admission, Native and model qualification, and authentication of the clock and registry freshness remain outside this evidence. [Current ordinary qualification](/tmp/Root-V4-CLI-live-main-reconcile-EsXXzUG0/actual-live-reconciled-V4-CLI-ordinary33-closed.json) · [Earlier isolated qualification](/tmp/P2-V4-CLI-ordinary33-isolated-Guide571-LzSFO07f/actual-isolated-V4-CLI-ordinary33-closed.json) · [Separate private same15](/tmp/P2-physical-V4-retained-handoff-current-trust-CLI-private-cy1j1i4x/SEALED-current-V4-CLI-current-review-retained-handoff-exact-two-private.json)
